        "PMC9365806::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9365806::web::014::psr_mechanisms"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The phase-selectively recrystallized microstructure reduces or eliminates weak interphase boundaries.",
